# NOTE: calendar.json is deliberately NOT ignored. The Mac publisher commits it to
# this repo every 30 minutes, so it is tracked and the publisher owns it — ignoring
# it here would have no effect on a tracked file anyway. Never edit it by hand, and
# `git pull --rebase` before pushing: the publisher may have committed while you
# were working.
